WHAT THIS IS:
- Die temperature: MEASURED. 44.681 C idle, 45.271 C with the design loaded, +0.590 C.
- VCCINT: MEASURED at 0.99926 V, the XC7A200T nominal (1.0 V for the -2 speed grade).
- VCCAUX: MEASURED at 1.80532 V, the nominal (1.8 V).
- The temperature rise with the design loaded is a thermal signature of the fabric doing work.

WHAT THIS IS NOT:
- This is NOT a power measurement. The XADC senses voltage and temperature, not current;
  the XC7A200T has no on-die current sensor. POWER_WATTS and J/token remain ESTIMATED.
